        <mxCell id="GNYwGQDYNVE5GSD1HZfe-87" value="Some tasks or events could be marked as background. The effect it would have is:&lt;div&gt;- UI could deprioritize its appearance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- AI could recommend better plans (primary tasks should not overlap, but background ones could)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=0;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
